ARTWORK BY OTHER PEOPLE
================================================================================

Two things here were drawn by somebody else, and each carries its own terms.
The MIT grant above covers everything except these.


1. The application icon

   share/icons/hicolor/24x24/apps/mdeus.png
   share/icons/hicolor/128x128/apps/mdeus.png

   Both are composites cut from Buuf 3.46 by Paul Davey, who publishes as
   Mattahan. Buuf is released under the Creative Commons
   Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 licence, and these two files are
   derivatives of it, so they carry that same licence rather than the MIT
   grant above. In short, that means you may use and change them with credit
   to Paul Davey, that anything you make from them must carry the same
   licence, and that you may not use them commercially.

   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/
   https://www.deviantart.com/mattahan/art/Buuf-37966044

   Nothing else in this repository depends on these files. Delete them, or put
   your own image in their place, and everything that is left is MIT.


2. Seven icon drawings in the stylesheet

   share/mdeus/themes.css embeds seven of GitHub's Octicons as data URIs: the
   copy and check icons on a fence's copy button, and the info, light bulb,
   report, alert and stop icons that mark the five callouts. Octicons is MIT
   licensed, and its notice is reproduced here as that licence asks:

