================================================================================
WHAT THIS PROGRAM NEEDS TO RUN
================================================================================

Nothing below is included in this repository. Each is installed separately and
keeps its own licence, and none of them places any condition on the licence
above.

  markdown-it-py     MIT
  mdit-py-plugins    MIT
  linkify-it-py      MIT
  emoji              BSD 3 clause
  Pillow             HPND
  python-xlib        LGPL 2.1 or later

python-xlib is the only one that is not a permissive licence. The LGPL asks
that a program using the library be able to relink against a changed version
of it, which an ordinary python import satisfies on its own: this program
imports python-xlib at runtime and ships no copy of it, so replacing the
installed library is all anyone has to do.
